@startuml
' Figure 7.3  Effect ledger states
' Reading order: left to right from reserved. The unknown state has
' four exits, chosen by the tool's contract. Final states are on the
' right.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide empty description
[*] --> reserved
reserved --> attempting
attempting --> committed : receipt
attempting --> failed : refused
attempting -[$FAIL]-> unknown : timeout
unknown --> committed : lookup found
unknown --> attempting : same key, or absent
unknown --> escalated : no key, no lookup
unknown --> abandoned : message
committed --> compensating
compensating --> compensated
@enduml
